{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Creature-Collector Roguelike Deckbuilding Game. Assemble your team of three Montabi so that you can outsmart the bad guys and save the city!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_team.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_taming_02.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're going to be the big hero and save the city, you've gotta get some Montabi! Each Montabi has a unique set of skills, giving you and your party of three endless combinations of options and synergies. Collect gadgets, equip charms, and chart the path to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_evolve.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_evolve_03.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train your Montabi to grow stronger, unlocking new moves to enhance your team's strategy. As they level up, your Montabi evolve into more powerful forms, gaining new card abilities and expanding your tactical options. If you work together, there's nothing you and your Montabi can't achieve! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_strategy.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_battle.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your best strategies to beat up the bad guys in a unique 3x3 grid-based system. With every Montabi's unique abilities, you'll have endless options to outthink the competition and win the day. Just make sure you rest up at a cafe every now and then to recover those hit points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_trainer.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_trainer.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from diverse trainers, each with a unique playstyle. Do you wanna put your team in the perfect position, get right up in their faces and duke it out, or buff up your Montabi with a hearty meal? When the city's at stake, everyone pitches in! Just make sure to stay safe! Like the king in chess, if your trainer is defeated, the game ends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_montabi.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_montabi.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ Montabi planned for release, each with a unique and distinct playstyle. Choose your favorite!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750130?t=1748967160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/d6af6d0c27f697e1a7c627c4345d466141c916c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748967160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/28fe5c1068655b74794cb6dadd6e3429cff69909/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748967160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/28fe5c1068655b74794cb6dadd6e3429cff69909/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748967160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/MON_Graphic_Steam_DemoProductLogo_1280x720_V1.png?t=1748967160\" />Demo Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and Fight with up to 40 Montabi!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve your Montabi into more powerful companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine different Montabi into a strong, synergistic team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize on the tactical 3x3 battlemap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat down the big bad boss of the local X Gang!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check out all the city has to offer in over 20 randomized events!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Creature-Collector Roguelike Deckbuilding Game. Assemble your team of three Montabi so that you can outsmart the bad guys and save the city!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_team.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_taming_02.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're going to be the big hero and save the city, you've gotta get some Montabi! Each Montabi has a unique set of skills, giving you and your party of three endless combinations of options and synergies. Collect gadgets, equip charms, and chart the path to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_evolve.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_evolve_03.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train your Montabi to grow stronger, unlocking new moves to enhance your team's strategy. As they level up, your Montabi evolve into more powerful forms, gaining new card abilities and expanding your tactical options. If you work together, there's nothing you and your Montabi can't achieve! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_strategy.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_battle.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your best strategies to beat up the bad guys in a unique 3x3 grid-based system. With every Montabi's unique abilities, you'll have endless options to outthink the competition and win the day. Just make sure you rest up at a cafe every now and then to recover those hit points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_trainer.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_trainer.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from diverse trainers, each with a unique playstyle. Do you wanna put your team in the perfect position, get right up in their faces and duke it out, or buff up your Montabi with a hearty meal? When the city's at stake, everyone pitches in! Just make sure to stay safe! Like the king in chess, if your trainer is defeated, the game ends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/header_montabi.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/extras/footage_montabi.gif?t=1748967160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ Montabi planned for release, each with a unique and distinct playstyle. Choose your favorite!</p>","developers":["Mankibo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3141630","name":"Montabi"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750130/2e43b400d601b3f6538ca0395218642126e3c584/header.jpg?t=1748967160","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140724,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140724/movie480.mp4?t=1748536251","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140724/movie_max.mp4?t=1748536251"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140724/53b1236c40cd8b6c5db6a0786570fcf72f864ed4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748536251","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140724/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748536251","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140724/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748536251"}}],"name":"Montabi Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550 Ti / Radeon HD